WEBVTT

00:03:55.985 --> 00:04:01.329
which was exactly how I didn't want
to spend the entire rest of my career --

00:04:01.353 --> 00:04:02.964
(Laughter)

00:04:02.988 --> 00:04:05.470
sweating, exhausted,

00:04:05.494 --> 00:04:08.481
placating stressed-out
graduate students --

00:04:08.505 --> 00:04:09.894
(Laughter)

00:04:09.918 --> 00:04:12.733
tossing scraps of PB and J sandwiches

00:04:12.757 --> 00:04:14.136
to feral dogs,

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:16.008
which is pointless, by the way,

00:04:16.032 --> 00:04:19.235
because Mexican dogs
really don't like peanut butter.

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:20.910
(Laughter)

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:25.486
Just the thought of it bored me to tears.

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:27.724
So I returned home to Colorado,

00:04:27.748 --> 00:04:30.328
and I poked my head
through a colleague's door.